 "captions": [
  {
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 1.509,
   "text": "My neighbor is a ~KILLER…~"
  },
  {
   "start": 1.509,
   "end": 2.45,
   "text": "and I'm *NEXT.*"
  },
  {
   "start": 2.62,
   "end": 3.45,
   "text": "Here's how it happened…"
  },
  {
   "start": 4.2,
   "end": 5.58,
   "text": "Our street was quiet."
  },
  {
   "start": 5.58,
   "end": 7.5,
   "text": "Nothing ever happened here."
  },
  {
   "start": 7.5,
   "end": 9.638,
   "text": "Then a new neighbor moved"
  },
  {
   "start": 9.638,
   "end": 10.9,
   "text": "in next door."
  },
  {
   "start": 10.9,
   "end": 13.2,
   "text": "\"Hello there. I'm *Mr.* *Gray.*\""
  },
  {
   "start": 13.2,
   "end": 14.9,
   "text": "\"Uh… hi, Mr. Gray.\""
  },
  {
   "start": 14.9,
   "end": 15.753,
   "text": "He watched me."
  },
  {
   "start": 15.753,
   "end": 16.9,
   "text": "Every single day."
  },
  {
   "start": 16.9,
   "end": 18.6,
   "text": "And he *never* blinked."
  },
  {
   "start": 18.6,
   "end": 20.3,
   "text": "\"Bye, Mr. Gray!\""
  },
  {
   "start": 20.3,
   "end": 22.2,
   "text": "\"See you *soon,* Timmy.\""
  },
  {
   "start": 22.2,
   "end": 24.3,
   "text": "That night, I couldn't sleep."
  },
  {
   "start": 24.3,
   "end": 26.0,
   "text": "\"Huh? What's that?\""
  },
  {
   "start": 26.0,
   "end": 28.1,
   "text": "A light. In his *basement.*"
  },
  {
   "start": 28.1,
   "end": 30.2,
   "text": "So I snuck over…"
  },
  {
   "start": 30.2,
   "end": 32.1,
   "text": "\"Just one quick look.\""
  },
  {
   "start": 32.1,
   "end": 34.1,
   "text": "…and looked inside."
  },
  {
   "start": 34.1,
   "end": 36.829,
   "text": "He was dragging something…"
  },
  {
   "start": 36.9,
   "end": 38.914,
   "text": "Something *heavy.*"
  },
  {
   "start": 39.0,
   "end": 42.0,
   "text": "*MISSING* posters. All of them."
  },
  {
   "start": 42.0,
   "end": 44.1,
   "text": "And a *shovel.*"
  },
  {
   "start": 44.1,
   "end": 45.9,
   "text": "\"No… no way…\""
  },
  {
   "start": 48.2,
   "end": 50.571,
   "text": "Then he stopped."
  },
  {
   "start": 50.6,
   "end": 51.92,
   "text": "\"I *see* you, Timmy.\""
  },
  {
   "start": 52.0,
   "end": 53.25,
   "text": "*HE SAW ME.*"
  },
  {
   "start": 53.3,
   "end": 55.198,
   "text": "\"~RUN!~ ~RUN!~\""
  },
  {
   "start": 57.0,
   "end": 59.1,
   "text": "His light went out."
  },
  {
   "start": 59.1,
   "end": 61.0,
   "text": "I made it home…"
  },
  {
   "start": 61.0,
   "end": 63.2,
   "text": "\"I'm safe… I'm safe…\""
  },
  {
   "start": 63.2,
   "end": 63.95,
   "text": "*Wrong.*"
  },
  {
   "start": 64.05,
   "end": 64.97,
   "text": "\"Found you.\""
  },
  {
   "start": 65.7,
   "end": 67.1,
   "text": "Everything went black."
  },
  {
   "start": 67.1,
   "end": 69.0,
   "text": "When I woke up…"
  },
  {
   "start": 69.0,
   "end": 70.7,
   "text": "I was tied to a chair."
  },
  {
   "start": 70.7,
   "end": 72.0,
   "text": "In *HIS* basement."
  },
  {
   "start": 72.0,
   "end": 74.1,
   "text": "\"*HELP!* Somebody help me!\""
  },
  {
   "start": 74.1,
   "end": 76.1,
   "text": "Then… *footsteps.*"
  },
  {
   "start": 76.1,
   "end": 78.1,
   "text": "\"Timmy… are you awake?\""
  },
  {
   "start": 78.1,
   "end": 80.1,
   "text": "Slow. Heavy. Coming closer."
  },
  {
   "start": 80.1,
   "end": 82.0,
   "text": "\"You found my little *secret.*\""
  },
  {
   "start": 82.0,
   "end": 84.0,
   "text": "Wait… my *PHONE!*"
  },
  {
   "start": 84.0,
   "end": 86.0,
   "text": "Still in my pocket."
  },
  {
   "start": 86.0,
   "end": 88.0,
   "text": "\"Don't be scared, Timmy.\""
  },
  {
   "start": 88.0,
   "end": 89.9,
   "text": "I had one chance."
  },
  {
   "start": 90.0,
   "end": 93.3,
   "text": "9… 1… 1…"
  },
  {
   "start": 93.4,
   "end": 94.9,
   "text": "\"911, what's your emergency?\""
  },
  {
   "start": 94.9,
   "end": 96.5,
   "text": "\"Please *HELP* me…\""
  },
  {
   "start": 96.5,
   "end": 97.4,
   "text": "\"Where are you?\""
  },
  {
   "start": 97.4,
   "end": 99.0,
   "text": "\"My neighbor took me…\""
  },
  {
   "start": 99.0,
   "end": 100.9,
   "text": "\"*42* *Elm* *Street.* Hurry!\""
  },
  {
   "start": 100.9,
   "end": 102.147,
   "text": "\"Officers are on the way."
  },
  {
   "start": 102.147,
   "end": 103.1,
   "text": "Stay on the line.\""
  },
  {
   "start": 103.1,
   "end": 104.95,
   "text": "He was right behind me."
  },
  {
   "start": 105.0,
   "end": 106.95,
   "text": "\"Who are you talking to, Timmy?\""
  },
  {
   "start": 107.3,
   "end": 109.15,
   "text": "Then… *SIRENS!*"
  },
  {
   "start": 109.15,
   "end": 110.5,
   "text": "\"*POLICE!* FREEZE!\""
  },
  {
   "start": 110.5,
   "end": 112.4,
   "text": "They got here *just* *in* *time.*"
  },
  {
   "start": 112.4,
   "end": 113.7,
   "text": "\"You're under *arrest.*\""
  },
  {
   "start": 113.7,
   "end": 115.1,
   "text": "\"See you *soon,* Timmy.\""
  },
  {
   "start": 115.2,
   "end": 116.8,
   "text": "\"You're safe now, kid.\""
  },
  {
   "start": 116.8,
   "end": 118.6,
   "text": "Always trust your gut. 👀"
  }
 ],
